    "texto": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">La Municipalidad de San Miguel de Tucum&aacute;n garantiza para el ciclo lectivo 2026 la continuidad del <strong>Boleto Educativo Municipal (BEM)</strong>, que beneficiar&aacute; a m&aacute;s de <strong>40.000 alumnos de los niveles primario y secundario</strong> que asisten a establecimientos p&uacute;blicos de la capital, permiti&eacute;ndoles viajar <strong>de manera gratuita</strong> en las l&iacute;neas urbanas de &oacute;mnibus (1 a 19).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">El operativo de <strong>inscripci&oacute;n y entrega de las tarjetas SUBEM</strong> comenzar&aacute; el <strong>lunes 9 de febrero</strong>, de <strong>8 a 18 h</strong>, en la <strong>Direcci&oacute;n de Respuesta R&aacute;pida</strong>, ubicada en <span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/Abg4odfH2Mbk6VTMA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>San Lorenzo 1270</strong>.</a></span> Los estudiantes que ya contaron con el beneficio deber&aacute;n presentar la tarjeta del a&ntilde;o anterior y la libreta escolar que acredite el pase de grado, mientras que quienes accedan por primera vez deber&aacute;n presentar constancia de alumno regular. La tarjeta ser&aacute; gratuita para nuevos beneficiarios y tendr&aacute; un costo de <strong>$1.500</strong> en casos de extrav&iacute;o o rotura.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">El programa contempla <strong>dos viajes diarios gratuitos</strong> para los alumnos y representa una importante inversi&oacute;n municipal destinada a fortalecer la <strong>educaci&oacute;n, la movilidad y la inclusi&oacute;n social</strong>, por decisi&oacute;n de la intendenta <strong>Rossana Chahla</strong>. La entrega de las tarjetas se realizar&aacute; <strong>por orden alfab&eacute;tico</strong>, de acuerdo con el siguiente cronograma:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Poppins; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Cronograma de entrega &ndash; BEM 2026</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Poppins; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">San Lorenzo 1270</span><br /><strong>Horario:</strong> 8 a 18 h</span></span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Poppins; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Lunes 9 de febrero:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Poppins; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\"> apellidos que comienzan con <strong>A, B y C</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Poppins; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Martes 10 de febrero:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Poppins; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\"> <strong>D, E, F y G</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Poppins; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Mi&eacute;rcoles 11 de febrero:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Poppins; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\"> <strong>H, I, J, K, L, M y &Ntilde;</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Poppins; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Jueves 12 de febrero:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Poppins; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\"> <strong>O, P, Q, R, S y T</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Poppins; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\">Viernes 13 de febrero:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Poppins; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: ES-AR;\"> <strong>U, V, W, X, Y y Z</strong></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>",
